{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20077","headline":"答昼上人止谗作 · 孟郊","name":"答昼上人止谗作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烈烈鸑鷟吟，铿铿琅玕音。\n枭摧明月啸，鹤起清风心。\n渭水不可浑，泾流徒相侵。\n俗侣唱桃叶，隐士鸣桂琴。\n子野真遗却，浮浅藏渊深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}